    <string name="ads_dev_note_community">Community work, not by the original Idena team. Same chain as the original.</string>
    <string name="ads_dev_note_thanks">Thanks to:</string>
    <string name="ads_dev_note_belief">What I believe: today an identity that fails to solve flips loses mining rewards, but an identity whose flips get reported loses nothing. That is unfair, and it weakens the network.</string>
    <string name="ads_dev_note_proposal">The proposal: cut an identity\'s mining rewards in proportion to its share of reported flips over the last 10 epochs. Also, an identity with 2 or more flips reported in a validation can\'t mine during the next epoch. If you agree, say so on Telegram, Discord or Idena Social.</string>
    <string name="ads_dev_note_help">Want to help? Feel free to fork the code, review it and propose changes on GitHub.</string>
    <string name="ads_dev_note_avatars">Robot avatars: RoboHash (MIT), robots by Zikri Kader (CC-BY 4.0), drawn on this phone.</string>
