    <string name="ads_fees_about">Fees: about %1$s iDNA.</string>
    <string name="ads_review_confirm">Send “%1$s” to review? Oracles answer “%2$s” (Approve or Reject) in a secret voting of %3$s, then the votes are counted for %4$s. The ad can no longer be changed.\n\nIt takes from your balance:\n• review fee: %5$s, for the oracles who vote\n• deposit: %6$s, back when the voting ends\n• stake: %7$s, half back when the voting is terminated, the other half burned\n• storing the ad on IPFS: about %8$s iDNA\n• fees: about %9$s iDNA, and a small one to launch the voting\nTotal: about %10$s of your %11$s.</string>
    <string name="ads_review_balance_too_low">Your balance is too low for this review.</string>
    <string name="ads_show_confirm">Show “%1$s” for 24 h to %2$s? It burns %3$s: the coins are destroyed. The ad then ranks against the other ads by the iDNA burnt for it over the last 24 h; burn again to keep it shown.</string>
